body:
My 4th app for personal planning. Just started to try it, looks great 👍🏻 love synchronizing with apple calendar, setting of Home Screen, where automatically you see habits and what you need to do today 👍🏻👏🏻 good organized settings of frequency of tasks and categories, so I can keep also additional lists there (like shopping/dreams/movie lists etc with also planning a date or with open one); 
Would be also great to be able to set date for subtasks (cos for now is possible to set it to whole task), but you can make task also already as additional category/project - then can schedule parts of tasks easily. 
Thanks for this app to devs 👏🏻👍🏻
